---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — MCCA Ventures">
  <article class="policy">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: August 5, 2026</p>

    <h2>Introduction</h2>
    <p>This Privacy Policy describes how MCCA Ventures ("we", "us", or "our") collects, uses, and shares information in connection with our mobile applications ("Apps") and this website.</p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Anonymous diagnostics and usage data</strong>: device model, operating system version, app version, crash reports, feature usage, and aggregate analytics collected through Google Firebase Analytics and Crashlytics.</li>
      <li><strong>Information stored on your device</strong>: game progress, preferences, and settings may be stored locally on your device. Unless an App explicitly states otherwise, this information is not transmitted to MCCA Ventures.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Our Apps do not require user accounts and we do not collect personally identifiable information.</p>

    <h2>How We Use Information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Operate and improve our Apps</li>
      <li>Diagnose crashes and technical issues</li>
      <li>Understand aggregate usage patterns</li>
      <li>Serve advertisements</li>
      <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
    <table>
      <tr><th>Service</th><th>Purpose</th></tr>
      <tr><td>Google Firebase Analytics</td><td>Anonymous usage analytics</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Firebase Crashlytics</td><td>Crash reporting and diagnostics</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Google AdMob</td><td>Advertising. AdMob may collect device identifiers and related information in accordance with Google's privacy practices.</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Apple App Store</td><td>App distribution and In‑App Purchase processing. We do not receive or store your payment card information.</td></tr>
    </table>

    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>Our Apps may display advertisements using Google AdMob. Ad personalization and related permissions are governed by your device settings, applicable laws, and Google's policies.</p>

    <h2>Data Sharing</h2>
    <p>We do not sell your personal information. Limited information is shared only with the service providers above to operate the Apps or when required by law.</p>

    <h2>Data Storage</h2>
    <p>MCCA Ventures does not operate servers that store user accounts or personal information for our current Apps. Analytics and crash information are processed by our third-party providers under their own retention policies.</p>

    <h2>Your Rights</h2>
    <p>Depending on your location, you may have rights to access or delete personal information processed about you. Contact <a href="mailto:mccaventures@gmail.com">mccaventures@gmail.com</a>. Because we generally do not maintain user accounts, we may not be able to associate analytics data with a particular individual.</p>

    <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>Our Apps are not directed to children under 13 and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.</p>

    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>Questions? Email <a href="mailto:mccaventures@gmail.com">mccaventures@gmail.com</a>.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .policy {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-lg) var(--space-md);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .updated {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin: 1rem 0;
  }

  th,
  td {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: 0.6rem;
    text-align: left;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
</style>
